WEBVTT

01:53.623 --> 01:58.322
The Masquerade Ball of Zaza Part 2

02:10.373 --> 02:11.541
He's been defeated!

02:11.541 --> 02:14.777
Cube de Ice takes his first loss!

02:14.777 --> 02:17.013
Who could that other warrior be?
Where did he come from?

02:17.013 --> 02:18.147
That bastard...
Who could that other warrior be?
Where did he come from?

02:18.147 --> 02:18.579
That bastard...

02:18.848 --> 02:21.408
All we know about this
strange armored warrior

02:22.018 --> 02:25.920
is that he comes from
another land far in the east!

02:26.155 --> 02:28.191
I am sure that this new, bright
warrior should be dubbed,

02:28.191 --> 02:31.752
the Warrior of the Rising Son.

02:42.104 --> 02:44.937
Warrior of the Rising Son?

02:45.575 --> 02:48.144
Hey, Jing! Things were going
well for our plan to snag the

02:48.144 --> 02:51.238
Vintage Smile before
this dude showed up.

02:51.981 --> 02:54.176
We've got to keep our eyes
on the prize, Jing.

02:54.517 --> 02:55.518
You're right.

02:55.518 --> 02:56.018
There he is, the guy from the fight!
You're right.

02:56.018 --> 02:57.110
There he is, the guy from the fight!

03:00.556 --> 03:02.491
Hold on, slow down, ladies.

03:02.491 --> 03:04.126
Are you his manager?

03:04.126 --> 03:05.061
What kind of stuff does he like?

03:05.061 --> 03:05.628
Does he have a girlfriend?
What kind of stuff does he like?

03:05.628 --> 03:06.262
Does he have a girlfriend?

03:06.262 --> 03:06.562
Does he have a girlfriend?
Oh, he'll easily win his next fight!

03:06.562 --> 03:07.756
Oh, he'll easily win his next fight!

03:08.297 --> 03:12.393
But of course! We wouldn't want to
let you girls down now, would we?!

03:24.580 --> 03:27.105
You're weak! You'll never
win the championship.

03:28.918 --> 03:33.014
Your eyes are going to spin just
like that mask on your head.

03:35.157 --> 03:36.647
What about your eyes?

03:40.730 --> 03:42.493
Hey, you're the Madame's...

03:44.100 --> 03:45.567
Let me go!

03:52.642 --> 03:56.479
Got it? We're expecting the Bandit
King to strike any minute,

03:56.479 --> 03:58.614
so don't let your guard down.

03:58.614 --> 04:00.283
Grandfather!

04:00.283 --> 04:02.285
Angostura, what's wrong?

04:02.285 --> 04:04.378
Miss Stir has gone missing.

04:10.793 --> 04:13.489
I wonder if she went
to the carnival?

04:14.196 --> 04:17.962
Ever since her younger
brother was assassinated,

04:19.135 --> 04:23.504
she has never been allowed
to leave the palace.

04:24.407 --> 04:27.476
At a time like this, when everyone
in the town is wearing masks,

04:27.476 --> 04:30.411
is really the only time when she
can freely walk the streets.

04:35.851 --> 04:37.443
This is Kir!

04:37.720 --> 04:39.989
This amazing young boy continues to
prance through the competition here

04:39.989 --> 04:43.425
like a comet, passing his second and
third opponents with ease!

04:43.959 --> 04:46.450
No one knows how to put an end to
this spectacular upset.

04:46.929 --> 04:50.057
He is well on his way to the finals,

04:52.702 --> 04:57.139
but the Warrior of the Rising Son
is also performing quite well.

04:57.139 --> 04:59.508
If they both keep up the same pace,

04:59.508 --> 05:03.467
a bout between the two
of them is inevitable!

05:07.083 --> 05:09.483
Hey, you've got to be ready for
everything in this business.

05:10.219 --> 05:11.686
Now then...

05:14.323 --> 05:20.353
The best fights of this amazing
tournament are still yet to come.

05:24.133 --> 05:25.134
Hey!

05:25.134 --> 05:25.634
Watch this, shouldn't take that long.
Hey!

05:25.634 --> 05:27.033
Watch this, shouldn't take that long.

05:31.640 --> 05:33.665
The time has come for the bout

05:34.009 --> 05:36.136
between the Warrior of the
Rising Son and Ginjou.

05:36.946 --> 05:39.382
Ginjou is finally ready to put his
money where his mouth is.

05:39.382 --> 05:42.151
His cheap, street fighting style
has gotten him this far,

05:42.151 --> 05:44.278
but will it be enough to
defeat the Rising Son?!

05:48.457 --> 05:49.924
Fight!

05:50.860 --> 05:54.897
He comes out fighting! He
was drinking pure alcohol,

05:54.897 --> 05:57.058
and starts things off with his
unique drunken fireball attack!

05:59.568 --> 06:02.838
It doesn't connect! Son continues
to successfully dodge them all!

06:02.838 --> 06:05.932
His light steps allow him
to avoid every attack!

06:10.679 --> 06:12.348
Ginjou didn't hit him once! The
proud Ginjou must face

06:12.348 --> 06:13.983
the fact that his sake attack is useless.

06:13.983 --> 06:16.417
He might as well be throwing
strawberry syrup on the Son!

06:18.354 --> 06:19.821
How about this!

06:24.493 --> 06:27.291
Hey brother, no more of this
prancing around like a girl!

06:39.942 --> 06:41.933
Ginjou! Where is Ginjou?!

06:42.311 --> 06:43.938
I have been defeated.

06:44.513 --> 06:47.448
I know when to admit my defeat.
Sorry for not dying for you guys.

06:53.689 --> 06:55.156
Later...

06:55.724 --> 06:57.624
Mr. Ginjou has been
respectfully defeated,

06:57.860 --> 07:00.693
and thus ends the White
Corrida for today.

07:05.334 --> 07:08.167
And now, we begin the Black Corrida.

07:24.753 --> 07:28.018
This is the traditional
illumination of the stage.

07:37.867 --> 07:39.664
Guess it's time to go to work.

07:47.877 --> 07:50.175
Miss Stir, have you returned home?

07:50.513 --> 07:52.037
The Madame wishes to see you.

07:52.915 --> 07:54.382
Miss?

08:01.257 --> 08:03.350
Please excuse me!

08:04.660 --> 08:06.127
Oh, it's just you Angostura.

08:07.596 --> 08:09.063
What do you want?

08:15.404 --> 08:16.871
What's this?

08:19.041 --> 08:20.804
Isn't this the medal my mom gave you?

08:21.510 --> 08:24.877
You always carry this around with
you like a good little boy?

08:26.448 --> 08:29.076
I'm surprised that cold bitch
ever gave anyone anything.

08:30.286 --> 08:32.914
I never see Her Highness' true
expressions because of the mask.

08:33.389 --> 08:35.482
So this is the closest I can get to
understanding her feelings.

08:38.060 --> 08:39.527
That's pretty foolish.

08:40.095 --> 08:43.394
Here, what did you want?
Does my mom want me?

08:43.799 --> 08:44.900
Yes, Ma'am.

08:44.900 --> 08:45.301
I'll be there after I change clothes.
Yes, Ma'am.

08:45.301 --> 08:46.359
I'll be there after I change clothes.

08:50.940 --> 08:52.407
Oh, thank God.

08:54.276 --> 08:57.439
If she would have found this I
would have just died.

09:04.086 --> 09:07.453
But what was she doing sitting
here in her underwear?

09:14.063 --> 09:17.794
Stir, the fight is about
to begin. Get ready.

09:18.467 --> 09:20.901
I'm sick of these fights. It's just
the same thing every year.

09:22.738 --> 09:24.673
This will be the last year
of the masked battle

09:24.673 --> 09:26.140
if there's anything I can do about it!

09:41.724 --> 09:43.191
It's you?!

09:46.395 --> 09:47.396
What's up?

09:47.396 --> 09:47.896
What are you doing?
You can't be here.
What's up?

09:47.896 --> 09:49.295
What are you doing?
You can't be here.

09:49.632 --> 09:51.293
I'm a little lost.

09:51.800 --> 09:53.502
You're not lost!

09:53.502 --> 09:55.402
This palace isn't the kind of place
you can just wander in to!

09:55.771 --> 09:59.468
There are more guards than usual,
to keep the Bandit King out.

10:00.509 --> 10:01.942
Is that so?

10:04.113 --> 10:05.580
How about this one?

10:09.018 --> 10:12.510
That's the dress my mom
used to wear to the balls.

10:22.331 --> 10:27.860
She looked so pretty in that dress,
dancing all night.

10:33.542 --> 10:37.308
But now all of the balls
are for fighting.

10:38.447 --> 10:41.780
I have never even danced
once in my entire life.

10:44.319 --> 10:46.583
What a coincidence, neither have I.

10:48.223 --> 10:51.954
I think that dancing would suit
you much better than fighting.

11:03.472 --> 11:05.099
Go join the guards stationed
at the eastern gate.

11:05.574 --> 11:07.041
Yes, Sir.

11:07.609 --> 11:08.777
What's wrong?

11:08.777 --> 11:09.111
We've just received word that the
thief is somewhere in the palace.
What's wrong?

11:09.111 --> 11:11.375
We've just received word that the
thief is somewhere in the palace.

11:27.096 --> 11:28.723
Are you lost too?

11:29.198 --> 11:32.725
No, I just like to jump
up on stuff like this.

11:33.569 --> 11:35.036
Find him!

11:35.304 --> 11:37.272
He's getting away.

11:38.040 --> 11:39.701
Good luck in your match.

11:56.358 --> 11:59.328
Just as expected, Baffle
of the Ice Brothers

11:59.328 --> 12:01.489
has made a quick meal
of his opponent!

12:01.797 --> 12:04.197
I can't believe how hard that guy hits!

12:14.743 --> 12:18.480
And next we have the
little Boy Wonder

12:18.480 --> 12:22.439
versus the middle of the three
Ice Brothers, Crash de Ice.

12:33.762 --> 12:35.229
Fight!

12:37.199 --> 12:40.168
Looks like you could
use a little trim, kid.

12:42.838 --> 12:46.239
Your clothes look a little
too big for you.

12:46.775 --> 12:48.343
With my special tailoring technique

12:48.343 --> 12:50.004
your clothes will fit good
as new in no time.

12:50.712 --> 12:54.944
Just don't complain if you lose a
few body parts in the process!

13:01.924 --> 13:06.418
Crash de Ice is turning the kid's
clothes into a uniform of death!

13:06.695 --> 13:08.686
He is utilizing his incredible
scissors as his only weapon!

13:08.964 --> 13:11.033
His skill with those scissors

13:11.033 --> 13:13.467
has earned him the well-deserved
title of Tailor of Demons.

13:24.613 --> 13:26.982
What do you think you're doing
with that? You're no tailor!

13:26.982 --> 13:28.745
You amateur!

13:41.496 --> 13:43.794
Jing, you idiot! What are you doing?

13:51.940 --> 13:54.966
What are these? The candles for
the altar at your funeral?!

14:04.620 --> 14:07.189
Staying up past your bedtime
and playing with fire,

14:07.189 --> 14:08.918
you're being a bad boy.

14:15.397 --> 14:18.600
Now it seems it has come time
to make the final alterations.

14:18.600 --> 14:20.135
The boy is done for if the
tailor catches him

14:20.135 --> 14:22.797
with the spinning blades
of those scissors!

14:25.440 --> 14:27.533
I hope red is your color, kid.

14:33.849 --> 14:35.316
What the?

14:35.984 --> 14:39.521
Whoa! It appears as if Crash
has been defeated.

14:39.521 --> 14:42.012
He has been brought to his knees!
What happened?!

14:42.391 --> 14:45.918
Oh, now I see. He's the only
one encircled in the flames,

14:46.428 --> 14:50.489
and with all that armor on, he's
steaming like a human boiler!

14:50.866 --> 14:54.165
Seems like all of his tailoring
equipment has backfired on him!

15:06.148 --> 15:07.649
When I'm done with you,

15:07.649 --> 15:09.776
you'll be too small to fit
into baby's clothes!

15:24.199 --> 15:27.691
It's all over folks! Nobody
thought he could do it!

15:31.840 --> 15:35.332
I told you Jing could never lose
with girls like you watching.

16:00.302 --> 16:01.792
It looks like it's fine.

16:02.504 --> 16:04.096
That Bandit King...

16:04.506 --> 16:05.941
Grandfather?

16:05.941 --> 16:10.708
This will soon be the most important
heirloom in the palace.

16:11.246 --> 16:14.647
What!? Are you saying that the
heir has been decided upon?

16:15.117 --> 16:18.186
Don't worry about that. There
is talk about that kid, Jing,

16:18.186 --> 16:21.289
earning the right if he
becomes the champion.

16:21.289 --> 16:24.850
But the champion has never received
the right to the throne before!

16:25.227 --> 16:26.762
The Ice Brothers have always
been the champions,

16:26.762 --> 16:28.229
even without the
promise of the throne.

16:28.497 --> 16:31.261
I think that kid is going to
make it through.

16:31.933 --> 16:33.400
There is no one else.

16:33.869 --> 16:35.270
If Lemon were still alive,

16:35.270 --> 16:36.760
this is about the time he would
have started his rule.

16:37.372 --> 16:39.363
There's just something
about that kid.

16:41.309 --> 16:44.278
He reminds me a lot of the
Earl when he was younger.

16:56.324 --> 16:57.791
What should we do now?

16:59.694 --> 17:04.290
This town is ours, we've earned it.
The Madame owes us big time.

17:05.100 --> 17:08.592
We need to do something before she
abandons us and it's too late.

17:09.438 --> 17:11.599
We cannot allow anyone
else to take the throne.

17:12.474 --> 17:13.941
Got it?

17:20.449 --> 17:21.939
Come in.

17:27.255 --> 17:28.745
What is my mother doing?

17:29.758 --> 17:31.658
She has already retired
for the evening.

17:32.594 --> 17:34.429
She said that tomorrow

17:34.429 --> 17:35.862
we will all be watching the fight
from some very special seats.

17:38.366 --> 17:40.698
It is the most important match I guess.

17:42.704 --> 17:46.936
Mother still doesn't want to admit
that Lemon is gone.

18:01.790 --> 18:04.020
Did you guys come all this way
just to ask me to dance?

18:14.202 --> 18:15.760
I guess not.

18:16.338 --> 18:18.602
Can't you can be more original
than a night attack in an alley?

18:19.307 --> 18:23.539
If you leave this town right away,
we'll spare your life.

18:24.513 --> 18:26.606
But you guys haven't even
started dancing.

18:27.082 --> 18:30.313
You leave us no other choice than
to throw you out in a body bag!

18:33.522 --> 18:34.989
What's going on here?

18:38.627 --> 18:40.094
What is the meaning
of this, Baffle?

18:40.829 --> 18:44.663
Bug off! Don't get in our way or
you'll end up just like him, kid!

18:51.673 --> 18:53.642
Even though they're
not wearing masks,

18:53.642 --> 18:56.110
I can't seem to tell these runts apart.

19:04.819 --> 19:08.550
Are you mocking the tools
of my trade, boy?!

19:24.139 --> 19:25.697
Kir Royale!

19:29.844 --> 19:31.379
Get him!

19:31.379 --> 19:32.846
This way!

19:34.950 --> 19:36.440
Stop them!

19:40.655 --> 19:43.146
They're getting away!

19:49.931 --> 19:51.398
Thank you.

19:52.701 --> 19:56.501
I can't believe they
almost killed me.

20:03.511 --> 20:06.207
You know what they say, absence
makes the heart grow fonder.

20:15.991 --> 20:18.551
Finally, this is the moment that
we have all been waiting for.

20:18.994 --> 20:22.330
The Warrior of the Rising Son
versus Wonder Boy.

20:22.330 --> 20:23.898
This fight will separate the
man from the boy,

20:23.898 --> 20:25.763
and show us our true champion!

20:38.613 --> 20:40.649
Madame Dubonnet herself is gracing
us with her presence tonight

20:40.649 --> 20:43.585
as she watches the fight
from her own special seat.

20:43.585 --> 20:45.917
This fight will possibly go
down in all of history!

20:46.521 --> 20:51.322
One of these two warriors will
become the heir to the throne.

20:51.993 --> 20:54.596
But of course, we mustn't
forget about Baffle de Ice,

20:54.596 --> 20:57.190
who still has a chance
to become the heir.

20:57.732 --> 21:00.035
But according to rumors around town,

21:00.035 --> 21:03.004
the Rising Son's beautiful fighting style

21:03.004 --> 21:04.673
has captured the hearts of the
people around town.

21:04.673 --> 21:06.698
He is favored to win the crown.

21:07.108 --> 21:09.668
And now, without further ado...

21:18.720 --> 21:22.524
Who will walk away victorious?!

21:22.524 --> 21:24.685
We will soon find out!

21:27.095 --> 21:28.562
Fight!
